#: kab/DialogBase.cpp:36
msgid ""
"If you press the OK button, all changes\n"
"you made will be used to proceed."
msgstr ""
"As jy die OK-knoppie druk, sal alle\n"
"veranderinge deur jou aangebring gebruik word om voort te gaan."

#: kab/Base.cpp:39
msgid ""
"When clicking apply, the settings will be\n"
"handed over to the program, but the dialog\n"
"will not be closed.Use this to try different settings."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer jy op 'Wend aan' druk, word die veranderinge\n"
"aangebring aan die program, sonder dat die dialoog-\n"
"venster toegemaak word. Gebruik dit om verskillende opsies te toets."

#: kab/DialogBase.cpp:44
msgid ""
"If you press the Cancel button, all changes\n"
"you made will be abandoned and the dialog\n"
"will be closed.\n"
"The program will be in the state before\n"
"opening the dialog."
msgstr ""
"As jy Kanselleer kies, gaan alle veranderinge\n"
"wat jy aangebring het verlore, en die dialoogvenster\n"
"word toegemaak.\n"
"Die program sal onveranderd wees van die toestand voor\n"
"die dialoogvenster oopgemaak is."

