msgstr "Omskeppingingsprobleem"

#: kab/widget.cc:145
msgid ""
"Kab could not convert your database to the\n"
"current file format.\n"
"You can use it, but not all features will be\n"
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Kab kon nie jou databasis omskep in die\n"
"huidige lêerformaat nie.\n"
"Jy kan dit nog gebruik, maar al die funksies sal nie\n"
"beskikbaar wees nie."

#: kab/widget.cc:163
msgid ""
"The application saved the last current entry,\n"
"but this entry does not exist anymore."
msgstr ""
"Die program het die laaste inskrywing gestoor,\n"
"maar hierdie inskrywing bestaan nie meer nie."

#: kab/widget.cc:229
msgid "kab: Removed bug warning"
msgstr "Kab: foutverwyderingswaarskuwing"

#: kab/widget.cc:230
msgid ""
"The version of kab you used before had an\n"
"error regarding the upgrading of the database\n"
"for new versions. This error has been removed\n"
"now and will not affect you anymore.\n"
"All configuration values have been reset to\n"
"its default settings."
msgstr ""
"Die weergawe van kab wat jy van te vore gebruik het,\n"
"het 'n fout ten opsigte van die opgradering van die databasis\n"
"na nuwer weergawes. Hierdie fout is nou verwyder en sal\n"
"nie jou meer affekteer nie.\n"
"Alle opstellingswaardes is teruggestel tot hul\n"
"standaardwaardes."

#: kab/widget.cc:248 kab/widget.cc:314 kab/widget.cc:322
msgid "File handling error"
msgstr "Lêerhanteringsfout"

#: kab/widget.cc:249
msgid "Unable to open database file r/w."
msgstr "Kan nie die databasis vir lees/skryf oopmaak nie"

#: kab/widget.cc:257
msgid "Email storage conversion"
msgstr "E-posberging-omskepping"

#: kab/widget.cc:258
msgid ""
"Kab will move all your email addresses to\n"
"the new style supporting unlimited numbers\n"
"of email addresses per entry."
msgstr ""
"Kab sal al jou e-posadresse omskakeling na\n"
"die nuwe formaat, wat 'n onbeperkte hoeveelheid\n"
"adresse per inskrywing kan bevat." 

#: kab/widget.cc:291
msgid "kab database update"
msgstr "kab databasisopdatering"

#: kab/widget.cc:292
msgid ""
"Please note that kab now supports some new\n"
"fields in its addresses. These new fields\n"
"are:\n"
"° the state field,\n"
"° the country field and\n"
"° the postal code field.\n"
"You will probably need to edit some of your\n"
"entries to make use of it."
msgstr ""
"Neem asb. kennis dat kab nou nuwe velde in sy\n"
"adresse ondersteun. Hierdie nuwe velde is:\n"
"\n"
"° die provinsie-veld,\n"
"° die land-veld en\n"
"° die poskode-veld.\n"
"Jy sal waarskynlik van jou bestaande inskrywings\n"
"moet wysig om hiervan gebruik te maak."

